As a Camera Creative/Editor at Whello, you are responsible for the entire process: from shooting the most inspiring footage to delivering a final product that makes clients happy. You work on diverse video productions: from corporate films to commercials, and from social content to branded stories. Together with a creative team of 42 specialists, you are given the space and trust to put your own stamp on every production. 
 What we offer 
At least 2 years of experience as a freelance DOP/Editor at a bureau or agency; 
Experience with professional cinema cameras such as Blackmagic and working with gimbals/rigs; 
Ability to independently edit and grade material into a customer-worthy end product; 
Have knowledge of DaVinci Resolve or Adobe Premiere, Photoshop, and Illustrator (After Effects is a plus); 
Experience with lighting sets and using audio equipment; 
You have strong communication skills and enjoy working in a team. 
Be in possession of a B driving license; 
have a good command of both Dutch and English, spoken and written; 
A rock-solid showreel can showcase what your talent reveals. 
Affinity with livestreams is a plus. 
You know how to commercially convince customers of your ideas so that they continue to grow. 
